      "title": "Practical Considerations in PID",
      "gist": "Applying partial information decomposition in practice demands matching redundancy measures to data type, gathering enough samples, and choosing among available software tools.",
      "question": "What practical choices must a researcher make to run a partial information decomposition analysis? (data type, sample size, tools)",
      "sourceHeading": "6. Practical Considerations in PID"
    },
