        "n0099"
      ],
      "range": [
        "spya-kmgwhs",
        "spya-uktkdy"
      ],
      "title": "Matching methods to data type",
      "gist": "Different redundancy functions suit discrete spike data, Gaussian-like signals, or mixed data differently, and no well-established option yet handles non-normal continuous signals like local field potentials well."
    },
