      "title": "Limits of PID",
      "gist": "Partial information decomposition reveals statistical structure but not biological mechanism, and it faces practical limits from exploding complexity and from errors in estimating information from finite data.",
      "question": "What are the main limitations of partial information decomposition as currently practiced? (three limitations)",
      "sourceHeading": "6.2. Interpreting PID Results as Neural Information Processing"
    },
    "n0108": {
      "id": "n0108",
      "depth": 2,
