        "spya-spdx0y"
      ],
      "title": "Interpreting PID Results as Neural Information Processing",
      "gist": "Finding statistical synergy between neurons does not explain which biological mechanisms, such as particular neurotransmitter systems or circuit architectures, actually produce it.",
      "sourceHeading": "6.2. Interpreting PID Results as Neural Information Processing"
    },
