      "title": "Practical Limitations of the PID Framework",
      "gist": "The number of distinct information components explodes combinatorially with the number of source neurons, becoming intractable beyond a handful, and estimating entropy from finite data systematically biases the results.",
      "sourceHeading": "6.3. Practical Limitations of the PID Framework"
