      "title": "Summary and Credits",
      "gist": "Statistical synergy shows neurons respond to patterns of combined input rather than summed totals, and this synergy varies systematically with circuit structure and behavior, pointing to a wide field for future study.",
      "question": "What does the evidence overall establish about synergy as a signature of neural computation? (a summary)",
      "sourceHeading": "8. Summary"
    },
