      "title": "Summary",
      "gist": "Synergy demonstrates that neurons are sensitive to the specific pattern of their inputs rather than just the total, and this synergy is shaped by local circuit structure and behavioral state, opening further research.",
      "sourceHeading": "8. Summary"
